    "signal": "At daily decision i,priorcompletedperpetualROC=C[i-1]/C[i-1-L]-1. Flat enterslong iff ROC>H,short iff ROC<-H. Inside or on entrybands,existinglong persists strictly while ROC>-E;existingshort persists strictly while ROC<E. Long exits at ROC<=-E;short exits at ROC>=E. Crossing opposite strict fullentryband closesold then opensopposite at00:01. E<=H,at exact +/-H no newentry. State is actualsignedquantity,no unpublishedprice/funding input.",
    "execution": "NextUTC00:01 nativeOPEN;closeopposite first then enter. Quantity=floor(spec.fixed_entry_notional_usdt/priorcompletedC/lot)*lot times direction;fixed raw N,no future OPEN/NAV/unpublishedfunding sizing;retain actualsame-directionquantity.",
    "allocation": "Independent10000USDT collateral;raw N1000/2000/3000 means10/20/30percent fixed initialcollateral per newentry,not targetweight rebalancing or NAV-scaled compound size. No borrowing/transfer/cashyield. Existing1x fullycollateralized postfee entrycap unchanged.",
